# The night watch (crows_nest). Optional; no puzzle, just the two of them and three stars.
dialogue watch
  node root quill "Took you long enough. Most cargo is sick on the second ratline."
    > "I was sick on the first. I'm efficient." -> laugh
      add aff 1
    > "I wanted to see what you see up here." -> stars
      add aff 1
  node laugh narrator "She laughs, despite herself, and then looks annoyed with both of us."
    -> stars
  node stars quill "Three stars. The Hook, the Lantern, and the one Pell called the Liar because it moves. Learn those and you'll never be lost."
    > "Which one's the Liar?" -> liar
    > "What do you see, when you look out?" -> see
  node liar quill "That one. No. That one. …See? Liar."
    > "What do you see, when you look out?" -> see
  node see quill "Everywhere I haven't been yet. …What do you see?"
    > "Ink. Every ship I ever stamped out of Vela. I used to wonder where they went." -> ink
      add aff 1
    > "Mostly the mast. It's very close." -> mast
  node ink quill "Well. Now you're one of them."
    -> father
  node mast quill "It does that."
    -> father
  node father quill "Your father. You think he's alive."
    > "He left the compass for me. You don't do that if you're planning to be dead." -> we
      add aff 1
    > "He owes me three years of birthdays. I intend to collect." -> collect
      add aff 1
  node collect quill "With interest. You're a clerk; you'll have worked it out to the penny."
    -> we
  node we quill "Then we'll find out. …We. Don't read into it."
    > "I'm a clerk. I only read what's written." -> written
      set night_watch
    > "(Say nothing. Watch the Liar.)" -> quiet
      set night_watch
      add aff 1
  node written quill "Then don't write it down either. …Go to bed, cargo. The Liar will still be here. Roughly."
  node quiet narrator "We watch the Liar for a long time. It moves, as advertised. Neither of us mentions that she's stopped calling me cargo for the last hour."
  node after quill "Still here? The stars don't need supervising, clerk. Well. Not by you."
    > "Show me the Hook again." -> hook
    > "Goodnight, Quill." -> night
  node hook quill "There. Like a question mark somebody forgot to finish. You'd hate it."
    > "Goodnight, Quill." -> night
  node night quill "Night, cargo. Mind the second ratline."
